(9866, '5W3eOm0K', 'One-Man Witch Trial', 'The broom, or rather the twisted mockery of a branch, is completely on fire. Grasping it, the heat is palpable as it runs up your arm. Runes glow midst the flame. You\'re ready to fuck shit up.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1200, 0, 0, 0, 50, 25, 0, 0, 0, 'onemanwitchtrialcard.png', 'appleRelisher', 'broomkind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:100000|Amethyst:100000|Cobalt:100000|Rainbow:1|Star_Sapphire:30000|Tar:80000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
