(10303, 'dL8DS?Rw', 'Maledictive Megatunneler', 'Thousands of runes sweep up across the flute of the drill, you begin to hear echoes of the dead as soon as you pick it up, and every single one is asking you how the hell can you even LIFT this.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6666, 0, 0, 0, 666, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'diggerkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Blood:300000|Frosting:400000|Obsidian:200000|Shale:200000|Tar:200000|Titanium:250000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
