(10653, 'ivNX7FR?', 'Russian Ratscrews', 'Knives with revolving gun barrels as blades. Or maybe they\'re guns that look and feel like knives?\r\n\r\nEither way, with these holstered at your side, you won\'t have much to worry about. Comrade.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 7, '', '', 'knifekind, pistolkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:600|Rust:600|Titanium:40|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(10654, 'eZYm1yuK', 'The Lights in the Sky are Santa', 'A mystical slingshot of legend capable of extraordinary accuracy and force. Its projectile is a bouncy ball imbued with the power of ice, spirits, electricity, and the cosmos. Legend says that Saint Nick himself used this weapon to fend off a legion of undead reindeer to save Christmas... twice. Those who wield it are filled with Christmas spirit the likes of which mortals can not even hope to conceive.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6600, 135, 45, 15, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'toykind, fancysantakind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Cobalt:111111|Frosting:111111|Garnet:250000|Malachite:550000|Rainbow:111111|Topaz:111111|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(10655, '5xt!ktkH', 'Salmon slammer', 'A fancy plank with a dead fish mounted on it. You half-expect the fish to come to life and start singing any minute now, but it never happens. It\'s just a dead fish. How depressing.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'statuekind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:12|Blood:20|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(10656, '0K900G08', 'Stun Capacitor', 'This curiously Y-shaped stunstick constantly pulses with a blue light, a label attached to the handle can be partially made out as \"2.1 gigawatts\". You have no idea what the hell a gigawatt is.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 8821, 0, 0, 21, 88, 0, 0, 21, 0, '', '', 'clubkind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:888888|Diamond:8888|Gold:21000|Rainbow:8888|Redstone:500000|Tar:21000|Uranium:210000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
