(10659, '1n1G000r', 'Super Citrus Mtl8r', 'A gun that fires Mountain Dew at 400 meters a second? Cool. A gun that fires 20 cans of Mountain Dew per round, at 300 rounds per minute? Fuck yes. As if the horrible gashes from the shredded cans wasn\'t enough, your enemies get the added bonus of delicious, citrusy Mountain Dew in their wounds.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 550, 0, 0, 0, 50, -1, -5, -10, -20, '', '', 'shotgunkind, automatickind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:130000|Frosting:73000|Rainbow:5000|Rock_Candy:60000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(10660, 'zR!th?lP', 'Samson\\\'s Bane', 'Used by the traitorous Delilah to strip the divine power (and luscious locks) from the virtuous Samson.  It is evident that this ancient razor retains some of that stolen puissance.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6666, 0, 0, 500, 0, 0, 0, 500, 0, '', '', 'razorkind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Blood:100000|Rust:100000|Shale:500000|Titanium:700000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
