(10804, 'gRzpVDv?', 'Chaos Rampage', 'The weaponized souls of two heroes combine to make this weapon, the harbinger of death and destruction with a legendary power.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 'chaosrampage.png', 'Pseudo', 'scythekind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:40000000|Amethyst:10000000|Caulk:5125000|Malachite:7000000|Mercury:12500000|Obsidian:6250000|Polychromite:2390625|Quartz:2062500|Rainbow:1953130|Star_Sapphire:2781250|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
