(10826, 'FVtpnt!z', 'Shade Staff', 'A darkly-colored staff. When your staff is this shady, people may suspect you of having a management problem. But you can manage your imps just fine.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 42, 0, 0, 0, 5, 5, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'staffkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:161|Jet:81|Shale:21|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
