(10901, '!!zzt!Y!', 'Die of Loki', 'A large blue die catalyzing the unimaginable power of the Tesseract, it glows with an iridescent blue aura. Basically it\'s the Tesseract with dots carved into its faces, making it a giant die and therefore wieldable. Hooray for strife portfolio exploits!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5556, 0, 0, 0, 556, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'dicekind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:555556|Opal:556|Polychromite:55556|Quartz:56|Rainbow:5556|Star_Sapphire:6|Uranium:555556|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
