(10922, 'Y3tck5mM', 'Green-flamed Wwhite Baton of Og\\\'og', 'This is it: the pinnacle of sciensorcerous bullshit. The raw natural and arcane power coursing through this featureless untarnished rod is insurmountable. Raw existence is yours to command. Even bringing two within arm\'s reach prompts a cataclysmic battle of jealous wills that causes one to shatter uselessly.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 'greenflamedwwhitebatonofogog.png', 'Jayayoh', 'batonkind, wandkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:20000000|Chalk:5500000|Emerald:4000000|Frosting:1|Marble:5500000|Obsidian:5000|Opal:3000000|Polychromite:3000000|Quartz:4500000|Rainbow:3000000|Sunstone:5000000|Tar:9995000|Uranium:6500000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
