(11034, 'pBrxrcr?', 'Timeside Story', 'Legends say that this knife was created during a short period of the eternal gang war between the Midnight Crew and The Felt. It is full of clockwork and shadow majyyks.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 8415, 0, 600, 0, 0, 80, 0, 150, 0, '', '', 'knifekind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Jet:800000|Malachite:150000|Marble:16|Obsidian:400000|Polychromite:48150|Quartz:1|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
