(11891, 'nzhzUVj7', 'Nuva Armor', 'The armor of the Toa Nuva, now life-sized. It looks like plastic, but it\'s pretty heavy and durable. You feel waves of nostalgia and silliness wearing this. Good thing nobody can see you.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10, 0, 10, 'nuvaarmor.png', 'melodiousPsyche', 'notaweapon', ' bodygear', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:300|Mercury:300|Polychromite:6|Titanium:258|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
