(11976, '4KB0L10X', 'Skrillet', 'The skrillet of Skrillex! This tricked-out diamond pan is the ultimate in dubstep technology: bright lights and sick beats emanate from the surface of the pan! Drop the bass on someone\'s face, or decapitate your enemies: jagged CD razors whir around its circular exterior like sharp, toothy propellers. Throw it at your foe! Watch as it veers through the air at breakneck speeds, tears through their jugular, and flies back to your palm like a proper Bangarang should!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6609, 6633, 6633, 6633, 0, 0, 6633, 0, 0, '', '', 'pankind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Blood:3000000|Diamond:160000|Obsidian:275000|Rainbow:225000|Tar:1000000|Titanium:300000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
