(12086, 'Y01bG083', 'Diablo', 'A stuffed raven familiar with a heart as black as its feathers. You guess you could learn to deal with having this feathered fiend as a companion... Until some fairy decides to show up and turn it to stone. Who even does a thing like that?', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 250, 50, 50, 50, 50, 0, 30, 0, 0, '', '', 'notaweapon', 'accessory', 'average', '', '', 'Jet:50000|Obsidian:10000|Tar:50000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
