(12137, 'SHHjYuYu', 'Thermos', 'A thermos that has been filled with coffee at some point prior to you possessing it (hopefully not too long ago, though). Throwing it at something is at least somewhat viable.', 'USEMESSAGE:You sip some coffee from the thermos. The caffeine helps you feel more alert. You toss the empty thermos when you\'re done with it; don\'t want to be caught hoarding!|BONUS:OFFENSE@2@1:0:None|BONUS:DEFENSE@2@1:0:None|HEALTH:4:0:0|', 1, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, '', '', 'foodkind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:4|Iodine:4|', '', 'look whos drinking COFFEE', 0),
(12138, 'ygTN8qj8', 'Golad, Twilight of Aspects', 'One of a pair of legendary daggers known as \'The fangs of the father\'. Incredibly powerful, made from black, jagged metal and pulsing with molten energy. The blade is dangerously hot to the touch, and holds a disturbing, moving eye. ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 3000, 0, 0, 3000, 3000, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'knifekind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Blood:1455227|Garnet:1142604|Obsidian:1359708|Titanium:373002|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(12139, '?YV39mzA', 'Tiriosh, Nightmare of Ages', 'One of the pair of daggers known as the \'Fangs of the father\'. It feels as if it is full of unbridled hate, and rage. Staring at the hate it holds, set against its black metal makes you want to destroy something, and with this weapon, you could easily do so.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 3000, 0, 0, 3000, 3000, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'knifekind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Blood:1493556|Garnet:1022660|Obsidian:1381200|Titanium:372675|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
