(12272, 'tv!pzT!?', 'Chainscythe of Memories', 'A chained scythe that absorbs the memories of those cut by the blade. Better than letting them die with the corpse, you guess?', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 53, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'scythekind, chainkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:950|Cobalt:600|Star_Sapphire:50|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
