(12456, 'P0Hc54GW', '\"Humming\" Swordsman\\\'s High Frequency Piratical Brolly-Sword', 'On top of ALL those things the sword made you before, you\'re now a pirate. These prefixes are getting slightly out of hand, and so is the awesome blade you are now in control of. Forget even moving properly, just sliding your sword in and out of it\'s sheath has a habit of tearing up the environment around you now. Don\'t be too hasty to fully unsheath it, lest you want to keep your limbs. Which you don\'t want to cut off. Again. You\'ve now the sudden urge to sing sailor\'s songs. Oh and \"Humming\" t', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 5000, 8000, 8000, 9999, 8000, 9999, 5000, -9999, '', '', 'umbrellakind, bladekind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:2000000|Blood:1500000|Diamond:900000|Gold:500000|Obsidian:500000|Rainbow:400000|Rust:500000|Titanium:1000000|Uranium:1500000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
