(12595, '!?tllVHz', 'Smith Corona Stratocrasher', 'This is it. You\'ve climbed this whole mountain and become a god of rock. A living legend. This is the most powerful guitar in the universe. Its strings sing at your touch, your enemies weeping at its magnificence before being blasted to ash by paradox space shattering power chords. With the Stratocrasher in your hands, you are a living legend. ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 0, 5555, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 5555, 0, '', '', 'stringskind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Chalk:5000000|Gold:10000000|Obsidian:5000000|Rainbow:5000000|Tar:2500000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
