(12864, 'xxpxxrx!', 'Double-Tempered W', 'One half of this inflatable letter W is coursing with heat, the other half is freezing to the touch. Hold it in the middle and you have a two-pronged attack of two temperatures! (oh wait, that was the wrong letter to alliterate with. whoops.)', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'inflatablekind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Amber:23000|Frosting:23000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
