(13250, 'o048e2mS', 'Star Oars', 'A long time ago in a galaxy far, far away It is a period of civil oar. Rebel rowboats, striking from a hidden base, have won their first victory against the evil Galactic Canoe. During the battle, Rebel spies managed to steal secret plans to the Empire\'s ultimate weapon, the Death Propeller, an armored canoe with enough power to get across the mighty Mississippi. Pursued by the Empire\'s sinister agents, Princess Longboat races home aboard her starship, custodian of the stolen plans that can save', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 135, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10, '', '', 'oarkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Mercury:4444|Tar:4444|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
