(13696, 'zQ!!7x!!', 'Triglaive', 'A powerful item created by the gods many years ago, coveted by evil. The ancient Triglaive is the secret of the power of Prospit. If Derse ever gets their hands on it, the kingdom will surely be corrupted by darkness. ...Wait, those are the rings. This is just a very powerful weapon. ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1265, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 0, 0, 100, '', '', 'polearmkind, bladekind, ninjakind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:300000|Emerald:40000|Gold:200000|Rose_Quartz:40000|Star_Sapphire:40000|Titanium:50000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
