(13701, 'W66i1Y2T', 'Four-Sided Lipstick', 'Lipstick with four different colours. Granted, they\'re all still horrible shades that no self-respecting person would ever put on their lips, but at least you get a choice. Other than, of course, the option not to even use it.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, -9999, -1000, -1000, -1000, -1000, -500, -500, -500, -500, '', '', 'beautykind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Amber:1|Caulk:1|Quartz:1|Uranium:1|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
