(13946, '1WdZ3ZW2', 'Skull Candy Cane', 'It seems that evil has a sweet tooth and with this candy themed skull cane you\'ll be the height of villainous debauchery.', 'USEMESSAGE:Now what kind of villain would up and eat their entire iconic skull cane? You, apparently. Oh well, at least you can always alchemize another...|', 0, 0, 0, 0, 45, 0, 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, -5, '', '', 'canekind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:400|Frosting:300|Marble:200|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
