(14173, 'VVlV!lnu', 'Black Wand of Tidy Necromancy', 'Channel the contrived science of spirit puppetry to command the raw power of doom upon your enemies and then enslave their ghosts to clean up afterwards. Hahahahaha. (And by \"clean up\" I\'m talking about the guts that are going to be all over the place.)', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 2000, 2500, 2750, 2900, 3333, 2950, 2450, 2000, 'blackwandoftidynecromancy.png', 'tarriedTaphonomist', 'wandkind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Amethyst:3333333|Blood:3333333|Emerald:2500000|Garnet:2500000|Obsidian:2500000|Opal:1000000|Polychromite:1000000|Rainbow:1000000|Rust:3333333|Tar:3333333|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
