(14842, '212100Q1', 'Barbed Pixelated Shovel', 'You put barbed wire on a shovel made of pixels. Having realistic looking barbed wire over a pixelated shovel looks weird, but it will work. Not for digging, of course. If you think barbed wire helps with digging, you might need to think about that a bit more.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'diggerkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:20|Copper:20|Shale:12|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
