(15560, 'BdfoX5Va', 'Exalted Demimonde\\\'s Spear of Royalty', 'The rubies and sapphires adorning the head of this glaive radiate ethereal flames. Once crowned Empress, the Demimonde Semigoddess ironically united the warring kingdoms of Courtesan Heaven and Strumpet Hell with this very weapon. Now, its power is yours to command.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9000, 500, 500, 500, 500, 500, 500, 500, 500, '', '', 'spearkind, polearmkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Gold:2500000|Opal:800000|Polychromite:800000|Ruby:2000000|Star_Sapphire:2000000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
