(15581, 'RQh!FzVt', 'Mystic Blade', 'Through a combination of the TRUEST MAJYYKS and WEIRD TIME STUFF (or potentially your own weirdness), alongside the powerful aspects of alchemy, you have crafted a truly magical blade, from who\'s iridescent blade a faint humming can be heard. Or it could just be a glowing sword. Who knows.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 10, 15, 15, 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'bladekind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Amethyst:5778|Gold:5778|Titanium:3409|Uranium:5778|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
