(15807, '!d!?lb?t', 'Blade of SPAAAAAACE', 'This polearm shines with the light of a billion stars, and every so often you think you can hear it whispering excitedly about traveling among them some day. You better keep a tight grip on this one, cause if you let go, it might soar into the atmosphere...', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'polearmkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Rust:170000|Star_Sapphire:40000|Sunstone:250000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
