(16155, 'wMR?l!v5', 'SCP-361', 'An old Tarot Deck. The cards Ace of Staves, Page of Swords and XIII - Death seem to be missing. The cards can change the way they look and readings done with them are exceedingly accurate. It is unknown if SCP-361 only fortells these events or manipulates them into happening.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'cardkind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:500000|Chalk:700000|Opal:3610|Polychromite:3610|Uranium:700000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(16156, 'cFVsF7t!', 'D-Wheel', 'Also known as Duel Runners, these bikes allow their Driver to participate in so called Turbo Duels. Or in other words CARD GAMES ON MOTORCYCLES!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'cardkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:20000|Mercury:5000|Ruby:5000|Tar:5000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
