(16171, 'o08e3WYS', 'Yellow Sun Nuclear Splitter', 'A nuclear axe with a blade so large and sharp that you could split a sun that\'s less large than that giant green one, maybe the yellow one there though. But seriously, don\'t do it.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6666, 6666, 6666, 6666, 6666, 6666, 6666, 6666, 6666, '', '', 'axekind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:20000000|Jet:8750000|Obsidian:4000000|Polychromite:1750000|Rainbow:1750000|Uranium:8750000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
