(16179, 'DvyjpGrL', 'Electric Flamingo', 'You mind think that Randomizer Corp is just throwing a battery on anything it can find, you\'re right. But you\'ll alchemize this anyways because c\'mon, it\'s a humming electrified flamingo. There are even sparks coming out of its beak!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'birdkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:15000|Rainbow:1000|Uranium:20000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
