(16274, 'dBZ1?VEx', 'Plague Doctor Mask', 'An old mask holding the grim reminder of Europe\\\'s devastating bubonic plague epidemic. Such a sad memory to hear. For some reason you can smell oranges and clover in this.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10, 5, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 10, 0, '', '', 'notaweapon', ' facegear', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:5|Blood:300|Obsidian:2|Tar:10|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
