(16276, 'yYiF0OhL', 'Scythe of Pestilence', 'Made from the forces of armegeddon, as well as poison of death brings forth this weapon! With but a swing, the Earth would fall to its knees! Too bad the meteors destroyed it first. Also the Earth doesn\'t have knees.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200, 200, 200, 200, '', '', 'scythekind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:90000|Malachite:91250|Mercury:93750|Obsidian:92500|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
