(16299, '420GH0W0', 'Beat Mesa Miniature', 'A large record with turning gears under it, said to only be harmed by Echidna\\\'s quills. This is not your session\\\'s scratching mechanism, so you can safely use this oversized disc as a shield or weapon, even against echidna! It\\\'s not like miniature sburb sessions get scratched every time this gets hit, right?', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'disckind, shieldkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:11111|Garnet:12555|Obsidian:13000|Ruby:12222|Rust:18000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
