(16376, '?R5pUNe!', 'Calling Card of the Noble Circle', 'It\'s a ominous dark card. Its colour appears to be black but the longer you look at it the more certain you are that it\'s actually a very dark purple. When you\'re alone you feel as if you can hear a voice coming from the card, calling out to you.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'cardkind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:666666|Amethyst:66666|Blood:666666|Jet:666666|Malachite:666666|Obsidian:666666|Shale:66666|Uranium:666666|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
