(16933, 'CQ4oGNex', 'The Sceptre of Ik \\\'ngrechslir', 'Fear trickles down your spine as you hold this staff, you now truly know what it means to be naughty or nice. You don\'t know who or what Ik \'ngrechslir is, but maybe that\'s a good thing.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 4500, 200, 200, 200, 200, 200, 200, 200, 200, '', '', 'staffkind, fancysantakind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Chalk:175000|Emerald:50000|Garnet:225000|Jet:175000|Malachite:100000|Obsidian:300000|Tar:100000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
