(17014, 'gP01SM87', 'Black Knight Armor', 'This armor seems to be quite ornate, with etchings everywhere on it. It gives off an aura of power, and the determination to guard the ruler of its previous owner. It seems to be charred black, yet it feels like it provides more defense.', NULL, 0, 0, 1, 0, 120, 0, -25, 0, -15, 0, 0, 50, 0, '', '', 'notaweapon', ' bodygear', 'large', '', '', 'Blood:1500|Garnet:5000|Jet:10000|Obsidian:35000|Tar:10000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
