(17027, 'w!zu?!t!', 'The Monster Manual', 'Normally the monster manual is divided into several volumes, since there are so many monsters in DnD, but this appears to a complete compilation of them all.\r\nYou\'re prepared for any monster from any DnD adventure, now! Unfortunately, you\'re not in a DnD adventure yourself.', NULL, 0, 0, 1, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'bookkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:25|Copper:15|Malachite:15|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
