(17109, '9oZ2cG8E', 'Smoky Mountain Pellets', 'Gritty, sharp, and possibly high in lead content, these smoky snacks are sure to put a smile on your face and a dent in whatever you spit them at. Available at the Great Smoky Mountains National Park gift shop.', 'SITUATIONAL:STRIFE:None|USEMESSAGE:You crunch down on the pellets and immediately realize that these aren\'t actually meant to be eaten at all! But you do start exhaling an alarming amount of smoke and rocky dust, which you blow in the faces of your enemies, slowing them down.|BONUS:POWER@0@-8:3:None|SITUATIONAL:NONSTRIFE:None|USEMESSAGE:You crunch down on the pellets and immediately realize that these aren\'t actually meant to be eaten at all! But you do start exhaling an alarming amount of smoke and rocky dust. Maybe you can use that offensively...|HEALTH:-16:0:0|', 0, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, -5, '', '', 'rockkind', '', 'small', '', '', 'Marble:11|Obsidian:12|Rock_Candy:12|Tar:13|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
