(17340, '?5e1i5Wh', 'Greenlit Sub', 'This mouthwatering, neon green sandwich is said to be the meal of choice for the Babby Overseer himself. He usually eats around 25 of them in a day, though he\'s been know to really pig out when there\'s nothing else to do.', 'USEMESSAGE:Somewhere in the multiverse, an item has been added. Praise Overseer.|LUCKBOOST@0@100:0:None:%TARGET% is made luckier!|BONUS:POWER@0@10000:0:None|', 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, '', '', 'foodkind, metakind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Amber:2750000|Blood:2750000|Emerald:3750000|Frosting:2750000|Malachite:3750000|Opal:1750000|Polychromite:1750000|Rainbow:1750000|Uranium:3750000|Meta:1|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
