(17595, 'XULIa0uC', 'Scythe of the Blood Apocalypse', 'This scythe appears to be made of Blood, and it radiates a faint echo of the Life energy that was sacrificed in its conception. Such a weapon could only be wielded by a particular variety of hero. A hero of... void. Yes, you\'re absolutely positive that Void is the perfect aspect for this weapon.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'scythekind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:300000|Blood:250000|Obsidian:200000|Star_Sapphire:150|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(17596, 'xP3TtSF!', 'Dual Dragon Scales', 'This pair of knives kind of look like they are made from dragon scales, but on closer inspection, they are only replicas. Dragons aren\'t real, silly! Doesn\'t stop them from looking awesome, though.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 12, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'knifekind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:25|Shale:18|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(17597, 'fW5L040H', 'Hammer of Yo-arthica', 'Forged by the metals from Winterhelm\'s greatest blacksmiths in the heat of Mt. Radicalia, the beauty of this potent one-handed hammer is practically unmatched.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'hammerkind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:250|Gold:450|Ruby:250|Sunstone:500|Titanium:500|Uranium:500|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(17598, 'xlnPPTyT', 'Rocket Staff', 'Some would mistake this for a very thin, long rocket. Those people have no imagination. The ROCKET STAFF has all the class of Wizard Buck Rodgers, and half the casual racism!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 42, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'staffkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:100|Shale:100|Sulfur:50|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
