(17619, '0C4N7EGY', 'Mermaid Angel Cosplay', 'With this on, you\'ll look just like a mermaid angel! Which, ironically, would probably be unable to swim due to its wings and unable to fly due to its heavy fish tail. You can\'t deny its majesty, though.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, -2, -2, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'notaweapon', ' bodygear', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:8|Chalk:8|Malachite:8|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
