(17629, 'eHvmYT06', 'Orb of Dawn', 'This smooth looking ball made out of some unknown grey gem is filled with an intense grey light and giving off grey mist that is filled with an exceptional amount of both light and dark energy that was somehow combined together. When you hold this sphere you can feel a sense of calmness and peace, as if the balance was restored in you. ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, 3333, '', '', 'ballkind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:2500000|Caulk:2500000|Chalk:2000000|Diamond:2500000|Gold:250000|Jet:2000000|Marble:2000000|Mercury:5000000|Obsidian:2500000|Opal:1250000|Polychromite:1250000|Quartz:2500000|Rainbow:1250000|Tar:2000000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(17630, 'mGtIH020', 'Sanic-Possessed Fuck-Shit Ralph Festive Toast-A-Matic Ogre-Plunger', 'It was possessed by an evil hege hoooge spirit, use it IF YOU DARE....', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 880, 0, 0, 50, 0, 50, -50, -100, -500, '', '', 'plungerkind, hammerkind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:25000|Blood:35000|Cobalt:50000|Obsidian:10000|Opal:2500|Rainbow:2500|Sulfur:7500|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
(17631, 'zBXDVjhV', 'The Pen is Mightier than the Bladekind', 'And lo, though the blades tried to gain admission with all their strength, the mighty Moderators did thus summon with pen in hand the power of the legendary Suspension Flag. So thus the Pen was declared mightier than the Bladekind.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'penkind, metakind', '', 'average', '', '', 'Chalk:100000|Jet:100000|', '', 'not a statement', 1);
