(17688, 't3zqs5mU', 'Einstein M. c2 Solar Gun', 'It may be a single-shot, but one shot is all you should need to wipe out most underlings, summoning up a gigantic explosion supercharged by the green sun itself. Is also useful for lighting up dark outer regions of space. (Warning: Keep out of reach of children.)', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, 9999, '', '', 'pistolkind, explosivekind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:25000000|Emerald:7500000|Obsidian:7500000|Sunstone:17500000|Uranium:17500000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
