(18206, 'ZT45Xzmp', 'Tome of Infinite Recursion', 'A book describing how it describes itself describing how it describes itself describing itself. There are probably even more layers to it, but you kind of got bored and gave up after the first chapter.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1888, 88, 8, 0, 0, 88, 8, 0, 0, '', '', 'bookkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:88888|Copper:88088|Emerald:80888|Jet:88808|Malachite:80808|Obsidian:80088|Titanium:88008|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
