(18209, '8160gS1K', 'Double-Edged Throwing Scythe', 'A scythe with a knife for a handle. Cut your foes with the scythe end and throw the knife end straight into their faces. You can\'t possibly imagine what could go wrong with using this. Nope, absolutely nothing comes to mind.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 4, 4, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'scythekind, knifekind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:23|Copper:23|Mercury:23|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
