(18306, 'xU!sp!Vt', 'Swiss Gunblades of Elemental Power', 'A pair of Swiss Army knives, except instead of knives, they have knife/gun combinations. One is frozen, one is almost too hot to handle, and sparks constantly leap from one to the other. You\'re not entirely sure how safe these are to handle, but they\'re effective enough at killing enemies.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9999, 9000, 9000, 9000, 9001, 9001, 9000, 9000, 9000, '', '', 'pistolkind, knifekind, toolkind', '', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:2700000|Amber:2700000|Blood:2700000|Caulk:2700000|Chalk:2700000|Diamond:2700000|Garnet:2700000|Gold:2700000|Jet:2700000|Mercury:2700000|Opal:2700000|Quartz:2700000|Redstone:2700000|Ruby:2700000|Rust:2700000|Star_Sapphire:2700000|Sulfur:2700000|Titanium:2700000|Topaz:2700000|Uranium:2700000|', '', 'not a statement', 1),
