(18632, '00200000', 'Fulgur Mortem', 'This has a rifle?!? Well, definetely not anymore. If it\'s there, the skullin the top of it renders shooting impossible. You can feel your hair going crazy each time you swing, and you have no haste in knowing what the ones who are hit feel, if they do at all.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 33, 120, 5, 5, 5, 15, -2, -4, 3, 0, '', '', 'scythekind, scythekind, bonekind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:11743|Cobalt:235|Diamond:12|Jet:2349|Lux:35|Moonstone:12|Neon:1761|Onyx:587|Permafrost:587|Rose_Quartz:117|Ruby:587|Star_Sapphire:12|Sunstone:12|Topaz:587|Uranium:235|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
(18633, '0010450O', 'Jelly Faygo', 'While the name sounds delicious, the supposed Jelly donuts you used to create this weren\'t what they seemed. Now you seem to have a slightly rice and seaweed flavoured Faygo... It\'s odd, but maybe you could get used to it.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 2100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'notaweapon', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Amber:0|Build_Grist:0|', 'I\'m thinking this could be a healing item that varies in what it actually heals rather than have a set value every time. Maybe it only gave you 1 HP, maybe it gave you 20, who knows what\'ll come from the mixture of rice and faygo?', 'not a statement', 0),
