(19543, 's3GO1H4c', 'English\'s Double Edged Sword', 'Another weapon trademarked underneath the Lord English brand. Surely this is the real deal unlike that pen you bought a week ago thinking you\'d carry the power of gods. And that inflatable pool toy. As well as that pack of cards... You get a funny feeling this is going to be about the same result...', NULL, 0, 0, 0, -1, 9999, 750, 0, 0, 750, 750, 0, 0, 750, '', '', 'bladekind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Blood:1140865|Cobalt:1711298|Iron:2281731|Jet:570433|Moonstone:2852163|Neon:4563461|Silk:3422596|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
