(19894, 'O20UDG0N', 'Aperture Science Pogocue-Shooter', 'A portal/pogocue shooting machinegun pair. Altrough hard to control, you can now shoot your pogocues anywhere you\'d like to have them!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 2754, 1175, 30, 55, 140, 85, 0, 45, 62, 30, '', '', 'sciencekind, riflekind, automatickind, cuekind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Amber:71427|Build_Grist:109888|Fluorite:49450|Garnet:16483|Malachite:21978|Rust:43955|Topaz:27472|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
(19895, 'lxiNqtsd', 'Mehrune\'s Dark Computational Bow', 'This bow has a 1% chance of killing any enemy instantly (excluding Alduin and other bosses).  It also calculates where the best place to fire a light consuming arrow.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 2559, 9999, 0, 0, 1600, 1600, 1600, 1600, 0, 0, '', '', 'bowkind, bowkind, bowkind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Blood:4430932|Build_Grist:4430932|Garnet:2215466|Iron:2215466|Jet:2215466|Lead:2215466|Moonstone:2215466|Tar:2215466|Uranium:2215466|', 'I found a grist thing on the old forums, it explained everything.', 'not a statement', 0),
