(20082, 'K08EOP07', 'Sucku-Lasor-Brush', 'This thing sucks. Literally. There\'s a vacuum in the handle now. You can set it to take in paints or fluids you wish to paint with or to splatter them all over the walls and enemies. It also still has a laser beam for some reason.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3114, 45, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'artkind, laserkind, appliancekind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Amber:3|Amethyst:13|Build_Grist:26|Frosting:26|Quartz:4|Rock_Candy:5|Sandstone:1|Shale:26|Wood:26|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
