(20091, 'S28VOP0l', 'The Paradox Brush', 'An unholy fusion of Magicks and Science, this brush-boomerang is absolutely impossible to understand. So impossible that it\'s just barely possible, allowing you to have it. And kill shit with it. Lasers, a vacuum, spinning blades, time magic, anti-magic, hell this thing has everything. Every time you look at it it\'s slightly different, as if it existed on a higher realm...', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3114, 189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'boomerangkind, artkind, laserkind, appliancekind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Amber:164|Build_Grist:1091|Emerald:164|Frosting:655|Gold:1091|Marble:55|Moonstone:55|Obsidian:655|Quartz:655|Rock_Candy:1091|Rose_Quartz:1091|Sandstone:1091|Shale:1091|Topaz:1091|Wood:1091|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
