(20380, 'u3WPn4WA', 'SPACIAL CUE', 'It\'s a long staff that ends with a knife, frayed bits of pool ball-colored wires and the like twined around its length. Two flashing solar panels flare out a few inches before the blade begins. This probably doesn\'t mean anything. Right? At least the annoying sound effects are gone, now you just hear what sounds like the static-imbued screaming of the damned from time to time. It\'s not a spear.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3213, 620, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 20, 0, 0, '', '', 'knifekind, staffkind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Amber:3116|Build_Grist:56089|Garnet:3116|Gold:3116|Iron:3116|Ruby:3116|Rust:3116|Slime:46741|Sulfur:3116|Sunstone:3116|Topaz:3116|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
