(20383, '!FlV!FWg', 'SPACIAL REND', 'You don\'t have a staff anymore. You don\'t even have a knife anymore. You have a laser knife. A blue laser in the shape of a knife is constantly ejecting from the handle of the black handle, sharp static sometimes emitting from the weapon. It feels like it could cut through the very breeze itself, but you wouldn\'t want to do that. ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3213, 9999, 0, 0, 0, 320, 0, 320, 0, 0, '', '', 'knifekind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Acid:419718|Amber:419718|Build_Grist:8394360|Copper:419718|Garnet:419718|Gold:419718|Iron:419718|Nitrogen:419718|Polychromite:419718|Rainbow:419718|Ruby:419718|Rust:419718|Slime:419718|Sulfur:419718|Sunstone:419718|Titanium:419718|Topaz:419718|Uranium:419718|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
