(20508, 'lBdtrRzl', 'Lil\' Tyke\'s First Memetic Hazard', 'A collection of images that make ears ring and colors bleed. Dozens of images, dozen of melodies, hours of fun!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3573, 90, 3, 0, 0, 7, -6, 0, 10, 9, '', '', 'bookkind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Chalk:526|Mercury:526|Mist:1053|Neon:1053|Quartz:421|Rose_Quartz:421|', 'a distract effect, i\'d say, given the concept. can definitely be powered down to balance!', 'not a statement', 0);
