(20528, 'A0LMB6Y2', 'Crystal Candy Dice', 'As delicious as they look, if you took a bite out of them they\'d probably break your teeth. They do look aesthetically pleasing though, for what that\'s worth!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3539, 44, 4, 0, -3, 1, 2, 1, -3, -3, '', '', 'dicekind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:193|Cobalt:77|Fluorite:77|Frosting:77|Quartz:77|Rock_Candy:77|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
