(20965, 'PJxdtl3!', 'Starry Dice of Mild Cosmic Power', 'Roll the dice for one of many fabulous and glittery effects! And don\'t worry, these fellas warp back to your hands when you\'re done! Glitterbomb foes! Create blasts of nova energy! Drain the life force of monsters like the god of death judging a soul! It\'s all at your fingertips with just a roll of the dice!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4157, 288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'dicekind, gamekind', 'none', 'small', '', '', 'Build_Grist:21186|Jet:21186|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
