(20978, 'ZFWW3oKL', 'Spacey Golden Mech Mallets', 'You can see the stars in the sky above you with this thing, even from indoors. The mallet seems to be able to shoot amethyst bullets out of the golden handle. It has a burst fire setting that you\'ll probably never use.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3225, 240, 0, 20, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'riflekind, percussionkind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Amethyst:7317|Build_Grist:12194|Frosting:12194|Gold:12194|Iodine:12194|Rust:12194|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
