(21107, 'vhttsl77', 'Daedric Dice of Absolute Destruction', 'Combine the powers of destruction with dice imbued with the power to destroy chunks of space, and well, you get some pretty rad gambling tools. ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4157, 9999, 9999, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'dicekind, gamekind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Acid:3479983|Build_Grist:3479983|Diamond:3479983|Emerald:3479983|Garnet:3479983|Gold:3479983|Jet:3479983|Onyx:3479983|Ruby:3479983|Silk:3479983|Tar:3479983|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
(21108, 'fgzrUDTJ', 'Cosmite Octet', 'The maker of these dice was never able to obtain the original Octet for their own, but they knew the code. Combining the dice of the most powerful pirate and then the most powerful gambler in the multiverse with the power of Oblivion itself? These dice will lay waste to all they roll against. Needless to say, the maker of these dice felt great accomplishment stealing from the previous bearer of the Thief of Light mantle. ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4157, 9999, 9999, 8553, 0, 0, 9999, 8553, 0, 0, '', '', 'dicekind, gamekind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Aquamarine:0|Build_Grist:0|Diamond:0|Emerald:0|Fluorite:0|Garnet:0|Gold:0|Obsidian:0|Opal:0|Silk:0|Star_Sapphire:0|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
