(21115, 'f2zHEDTJ', 'Cosmite Octet of the Black Rose', 'Ebony petals cascade upon the table like a rain of sorrow, the roll of the die just one step forward to one\'s inevitable demise. Who\'s to say such frivolity is meaningful when it only eventually leads to the eventual end. \r\n\r\n\r\nThese dice are fucking rad, kind of insanity provoking though. ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4157, 9999, 9999, 9999, 0, 9999, 9999, 9999, 0, 4000, '', '', 'dicekind, gamekind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Acid:0|Blood:0|Build_Grist:0|Diamond:0|Emerald:0|Gold:0|Jet:0|Onyx:0|Opal:0|Ruby:0|Silk:0|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
