(21168, 'sV!!6wTR', 'Time Ski Poles', 'These green crystal ski poles are perfect for skiing along the timeline into the future, such as to a time when their sharp points are eviscerating an enemy.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3313, 1600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'spearkind, sportskind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Aquamarine:42319|Build_Grist:42319|Cobalt:42319|Malachite:42319|Mist:84638|Permafrost:84638|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
(21169, '01r8Y0z0', 'Tesla\'s Green Thumbs', 'These strange gloves are crackling with with green electrical bolts that assist in galvanizing the earth for your plants. Be careful not to actually touch your plants as they might catch fire.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4641, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'sciencekind, glovekind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:64|', 'Feel free to do whatever you want with it. Playing a glovekind character, I just think it would be a really cool addition.', 'not a statement', 0),
