(21172, 'EpRMyhuR', 'The Lunar Gent\'s Suit Presser', 'The lunar gents suit presser will press your lunar suit to the most crispiest of crisp while bashing your enemies to the most pulpiest of pulps. Smashing!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3437, 160, 4, 2, 2, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Blood:1381|Jet:1381|Rock_Candy:2762|Shale:2762|', 'Tally ho!', 'not a statement', 0),
(21173, 'Lwy!?RVN', 'Chip-Edged Waterbrush', 'This multipurpose paintbrush is useful for both art and combat. The tapered ends of the stiff bristles make clean lines on canvas - and lacerations in enemies interrupting your important work. It can even paint underwater!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4623, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'artkind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Amber:13|Aquamarine:16|Build_Grist:6|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
(21174, 'Ia4rX72O', 'Void Knight\'s Dark Armor', 'A reinforced set of Knight of Void pajamas complete with a stylish coat, the Void symbol, a depressing aura, and a feeling that it belongs to someone else.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 0, 0, 500, 0, 0, 0, 500, '', '', 'notaweapon', 'body', 'average', 'AFFINITY:Void:20|', '', 'Build_Grist:80000|Jet:80000|Malachite:60000|Gold:60000|Uranium:80000|Emerald:60000|Star_Sapphire:20000|Opal:80000|Polychromite:80000|', '', 'This is probably a bug, please @@@@@@@@@', 0),
(21175, 'G01K0GKK', 'Palkiarmor', 'Although this armor modeled after the Pokemon god of space STILL doesn\'t give any wibbly wobbly spacey wacey powers, it does amplify your aspect\'s in addition to being very protective! Make sure you have something to power the suit with.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 650, 50, 0, 0, -50, 50, 0, 0, -50, '', '', 'notaweapon', 'bodygear', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:5000|Nitrogen:10000|Lux:41300|', '', 'XXXXXXXXXXXXVL!J/============', 0),
(21176, 'paAl3m?y', 'Render of Nightmares', 'a weapon used by a demon to survive the Nightmare realm. it almost seems to scream.  ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4623, 872, 0, 20, 0, 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'axekind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Amber:37119|Blood:37119|Build_Grist:37119|Garnet:37119|Tar:37119|', 'good for Doom players', 'not a statement', 0),
(21177, 'LYuVyRUN', 'Deepsea Sharktooth Waterbrush', 'This paintbrush is certainly menacing to look at! The handle is made of sanded stone, deep blue in color that you could swear has iridescence like water. Shark teeth line the extended case, and the bristles are dense enough to cut through wood!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4623, 80, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, '', '', 'artkind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Amber:178|Aquamarine:355|Build_Grist:178|Cobalt:266|Sandstone:89|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
(21178, 'HeYtH8OH', 'Abstraction of Nicholas', 'There\'s no fancysanta here, and there never will be. You\'re not sure what could possible give someone that impression.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'metakind, fancysantakind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Acid:0|Build_Grist:0|Silicon:0|Slime:0|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
(21179, '!NPnWXxp', 'Thermonuclear Ace', 'Upon firing(playing?) this card, you can empty the entire casino, and in fact the whole continent. It sounds like only fire lives here now.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1298, 9999, 1984, 1984, 1984, 1984, 2036, 2036, 2036, 2036, '', '', 'pistolkind, cardkind, sciencekind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Amethyst:1532162|Copper:1532162|Diamond:1532162|Emerald:1532162|Garnet:1532162|Malachite:3064324|Mercury:3064324|Obsidian:1532162|Rust:1532162|Silicon:1532162|Sunstone:1532162|Uranium:7660810|', 'lots of dystopia references in the stats, a fair and referential power level, definitely usable for further alchemy. ', 'not a statement', 0),
