(21188, 'gH0mQK8I', 'Caestus', 'The weapon augments one\'s bare hands\r\nwith thick, studded leather.\r\n\r\nThe Caestus has a short reach, but quickly\r\ncools down. Amount of damage inflicted is\r\ndependent on its wearer\'s strength.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 3458, 10, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, '', '', 'glovekind', 'none', 'small', '', '', 'Build_Grist:43|Jet:26|Rust:17|', 'I\'m pretty new to this game, I\'m just basing the Bonuses off of the boxing gloves', 'not a statement', 0),
