(21194, 'g0q3ZBcK', 'Continuum Weaver', 'So, you know how there\'s a fabric of space and time? Ever wondered how space got weaved? No? Well too bad, now you get to fight with it.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4737, 574, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 50, '', '', 'batonkind, needlekind, wandkind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Blood:31619|Build_Grist:126477|Frosting:31619|', 'I just thought that the Continuum Orchestrator could also be a wand. Then I thought, hey, you know what, why not make it a weaving item?\r\n\r\nBasically made this for my convenience, yeah.\r\n\r\nIf you actually add it in, you could do something to fit with the whole \"Fabric of Reality\" theme.', 'not a statement', 0),
(21195, '090SAV53', 'Tahu\'s Wandbrella', 'For some reason, you thought it might be a good idea to make an umbrella into a sword. Not stopping there, you then enchanted the living bejesus out of it and thus the Wandbrella was born. Now smaller for convenience!', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4737, 1800, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 100, '', '', 'umbrellakind, wandkind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Acid:55137|Build_Grist:220548|Frosting:165411|Rock_Candy:110274|', 'This was mainly made for convenience, but you ought to add swordkind to this too if you can.\r\n\r\nHonestly it\'s probably not something you should add to the game, but upgrading this intra-session tool to be more freeform would be cool (but perhaps you\'d add admin constrants to it for balance).', 'not a statement', 0),
(21196, '4140H55?', 'Lizard Key Chain', 'A plush lizard on the end of a chain. Might be able to scare away the more squeemish enemies with this one. ', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4669, 5, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'chainkind', 'none', 'tiny', '', '', 'Build_Grist:21|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
