(21261, '11PXW0lc', 'The Weapon of A Fallen Mage', 'A weapon that has been lost in time. It was used once in the war among what was known as the Magic Apocalypse among magicans; mage against mage, Pitch against Snow. This, like many others, were once used in the dreadful war. However, in the hands of a Normal, it grants no magic. It\'s still pretty cool to hold, though.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4275, 3300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'spearkind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Blood:213058|Neon:319587|Rose_Quartz:426116|Rust:106529|', 'a reference to Simon Snow/Carry On by rainbow rowell!', 'not a statement', 0),
