(21287, 'MPpn36GQ', 'Clock Blocker', 'A Shield with a clock face on the front, permanently frozen at a time that happens to correspond with the date of your birthday. Despite it\'s complete lack of use as a time keeping device, it\'s actually quite sturdy.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4803, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10, 12, 10, '', '', 'shieldkind, clockkind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Build_Grist:1522|Frosting:304|Gold:761|Permafrost:304|Quartz:152|Rust:457|', 'few will guess that the name is actually a reference to a completely different massive work of web fiction. Bonus points to any devs that know what it is.\r\nAs a possible effect: once a fight it can prevent an enemy from attacking for anywhere from 1-3 turns.\r\nOr something, I don\'t know how hard programming that in would be.', 'not a statement', 0),
