(21372, '4B1IGmns', 'The Eyes of Modtaku', 'When you first see them, these anime-style sunglasses seem very odd--all the flashy characteristics they used to have are gone. But when you look through them, you see...everything. Almost as if you can see into the code of the game itself...', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 4946, 2500, 0, 0, 147, 147, 147, 147, 0, 0, '', '', '', ', ', 'average', '', '', 'Amethyst:120125|Aquamarine:120125|Chalk:120125|Frosting:120125|Lux:240249|Marble:240249|Moonstone:120125|Neon:240249|Opal:12012|Plasma:12012|Polychromite:12012|Rainbow:12012|Rose_Quartz:60062|Sunstone:60062|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
