(21808, '46mm1L4H', 'Bamboo Back-Spinner', 'A balanced length of wood, decorated elegantly. Well suited for those who find themselves bashing the heads of ruffians who interrupt a game of Table Stickball.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 5490, 14, 3, 3, 0, 2, 0, -2, 0, 0, '', '', 'staffkind, cuekind', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Blood:17|Build_Grist:66|Malachite:17|', 'I\'m not sure how much it should cost. Any help would be appreciated', 'not a statement', 0),
