(21864, '2ee5a5CZ', 'Binary Lagann Bow', 'A bow that looks like it came straight out\'a Gurren Lagann. The colors match the Gurren Lagann robot and it\'s a very angular bow made of metal. The bow can shoot lazers and arrows that blow up on contact. It also has a little shield that pops out while your shooting. In addition, the bow has a little triangular screen on it right next to where the hand goes and it shows a bunch of calculated lengths and parabolas so the user knows what shot will go where. Missing a shot is much less likely now, and you feel pretty badass just holding this thing.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 5004, 518, -4, 6, 14, 15, -6, -3, 0, 14, '', '', 'bowkind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:56190|Iron:22476|Malachite:8428|Neon:5619|Shale:5619|Tar:16857|Titanium:11238|', 'Grist is up for debate, and I was also hoping this could be a little more powerful.', 'not a statement', 0),
