(21881, 'CQ?mycGM', 'Four in the Mourning Umbrella', 'The perfect umbrella for all those Early morning funerals. This large black umbrella is made up of a surprisingly plush material, as a result it is stunningly in-effective against any serious weather, but for some reason you feel warm whilst holding it. The handle seems to be comprised of an oversized black cigarette holder. The canopy is decorated with a subtle starry theme and a midnight-green trim giving the umbrella an unbelievable classy look, and for some reason it gives off the sophisticated aroma of someone who has completed some serious business and is now in dire need of an overpriced coffee.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 5108, 120, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, '', '', 'umbrellakind', 'none', 'large', '', '', 'Build_Grist:4250|Emerald:4250|Shale:4250|Silk:4250|Tar:8499|Uranium:4250|', 'I don\'t know, maybe a better grist spread? Felt themed', 'not a statement', 0),
