(21886, 'Ieu02aCZ', 'Anime Brobot', 'What was once a plastic skate boarding game guide robot wearing a hat is now a metal strifing bot wearing kamina shades and has spiked back metallic hair. The hat it was wearing previously seems to have become a picture of a hat on its chest. The bot is set to strife mode and can fight along side you if need be while matching your strifing abilities. Alone it seems to mimick the fighting style seen in Gurren Lagann. Instead of shouting game cheat codes, the bot now shouts striding moves that can aid you in your fights. Outside of that, it\'s doesn\'t say much.', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 5004, 49, 2, 0, 6, 8, 1, -4, -1, 3, '', '', '', 'none', 'average', '', '', 'Iron:791|Redstone:395|', '', 'not a statement', 0),
