('General', '', '', '', '', 'Light is an interesting aspect, encompassing both literal light and the somewhat more ephemeral concept of luck. Light players generally have the ability to bolster or siphon luck, as well as some more mundane light-based abilities.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
