('Denizen', 'Typheus', 'Sophia', 'Hemera', 'Abraxas', 'Cetus', 'Metis', 'Armok', 'Moros', 'Lyssa', 'Nyx', 'Echidna', 'Hephaestus', 'Denizens are powerful monsters that slumber deep within the planets of the players. There are many ways to deal with them, but doing so is one of only two ways to access the Battlefield.');
